        "original_id": "a4b7e075-9846-5894-87fd-aeec9c662ab2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: “Be Right There”, “The Warrior’s Gate”\n- People: Diplo, Sleepy Tom, Priscilla Renea, Luc Besson, Robert Mark Kamen\n- Topics: song credits, film release\n\nFacts:\n- “Be Right There” is a song recorded by producers Diplo and Sleepy Tom and features uncredited vocals from Priscilla Renea.\n- “The Warrior’s Gate” is a 2016 Chinese-French action-adventure-fantasy film directed and written by Luc Besson and Robert Mark Kamen.\n- “Be Right There” was featured in the film “The Warrior’s Gate.”\n- “The Warrior’s Gate” was released in China on November 18, 2016, in 2D, 3D, and China Film Giant Screen 3D.\n- “The Warrior’s Gate” was also released in the United States on VOD on May 5th.",
